<https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/>
    dcterms:title "PubChem" ;
    dcterms:creator "National Center for Biotechnology Information, US National Library of Medicine" ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/home/about/policies/ (fetched 2026-10-04): \"Information that is created by or for the US government on this site is within the public domain.\" The same page warns that PubChem incorporates material contributed by others that may be protected; only PubChem's own computed molecular formulas were used: PubChem's record of the molecular formula (checked for water, CID 962) attributes it to \"Computed by PubChem 2.2 (PubChem release 2025.04.14)\"; the card formulas were compared only with the PubChem-computed formulas returned by PUG REST."@en ;
    dcterms:title "PubChem: compound records of the 43 ions (molecular formula, charge, title and IUPAC name)" ;
    dcterms:creator "National Center for Biotechnology Information, US National Library of Medicine" ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/home/about/policies/ (fetched 2026-10-04): \"Information that is created by or for the US government on this site is within the public domain.\" The same page notes that the site also holds material contributed by others; only PubChem-computed values were used: the molecular formula of the sulfate ion (CID 1117) is attributed to \"Computed by PubChem 2.2 (PubChem release 2025.09.15)\" (query 7), and the formula and charge of every ion were taken from the same computed property table."@en .

