    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "https://www.royal.uk/about-site — the footer of every page reads \"The Royal Household © Crown Copyright\"; the about page grants only linking (\"You do not have to ask permission to link directly to pages hosted on this site.\"); no open licence (such as the Open Government Licence) is offered for the text (https://www.royal.uk/terms-and-conditions and https://www.royal.uk/copyright answer HTTP 404), so all rights are reserved. Verification only."@en .

