<https://www.kungligaslotten.se/english/royal-palaces-and-sites/drottningholm-palace/history.html>
    dcterms:title "Kungliga slotten (the Royal Palaces): \"Drottningholms' History\" and \"The Royal Palace: History\"" ;
    dcterms:creator "Kungliga Hovstaterna (the Royal Court of Sweden)" ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The two history pages read on 2026-10-04 state no licence and no copyright notice, and neither does the site's \"About the website\" page (https://www.kungligaslotten.se/english/about-the-site.html, read 2026-10-04), which says only that \"www.kungligaslotten.se is the official website for the ten royal palaces and their attractions\" and covers cookies and privacy. No licence to reuse the text was found, so the site is treated as unknown: verification only."@en .

<https://www.teatroallascala.org/en/the-theater/history.html>
    dcterms:title "Teatro alla Scala: \"History\"" ;
