    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Footer of the page (read 2026-10-04): \"© 2026 Teatro alla Scala\"; no licence is offered (a legal-notes page was tried at https://www.teatroallascala.org/en/legal-notes.html and answered HTTP 404). Treated as all rights reserved: verification only."@en .

