    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "https://www.guggenheim-bilbao.eus/en/legal-information (\"Legal information\", linked from the footer of the page used; read 2026-10-04): \"... are the property of GMBF or its legitimate owners. All rights reserved.\" and \"The User is therefore expressly prohibited to reproduce, transform, distribute, publicly communicate, make available, extract, reuse, resend or use in any way and by any means or procedure, any part of the website, except when lawful to do so or when authorization has been provided by the ho[lder]\". Verification only."@en .

<https://fallingwater.org/history/the-kaufmanns-fallingwater/designing-fallingwater/>
