    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Footer of the text pages (e.g. https://www.perseus.tufts.edu/hopper/text?doc=Perseus:text:1999.02.0137:book=34:chapter=18): \"This work is licensed under a Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 United States License.\" (the United States port of CC BY-SA 3.0; the 1855 and 1918 translations themselves are old enough to be in the public domain). Verification only. Recorded as CC-BY-SA-3.0 (the unported licence's identifier) because the builder has no identifier for the United States port; the pages also add \"An XML version of this text is available for download, with the additional restriction that you offer Perseus any modifications you make.\" (not relevant: nothing was downloaded or modified)."@en .

