    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "README of https://github.com/factbook/factbook.json (commit 144d6977b2b01ac1cbd220de754c0a005616760b): \"The World Factbook [1][2] published by the Central Intelligence Agency (CIA) offers free country profiles in the public domain (that is, no copyright(s), no rights reserved, no license).\" and \"The datasets and scripts are dedicated to the public domain.\" The CIA ended The World Factbook in February 2026 (https://www.cia.gov/stories/story/spotlighting-the-world-factbook-as-we-bid-a-fond-farewell/, 4 February 2026: \"The World Factbook, has sunset.\"); the country files of this repository were last updated on 22 January 2026 (\"auto-update week 4\"). Used for verification only."@en .

