    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "https://www.usgs.gov/information-policies-and-instructions/copyrights-and-credits (fetched 2026-10-04): \"USGS-authored or produced data and information are considered to be in the U.S. Public Domain.\" The page is a USGS publication and carries no third-party credit for the passages used."@en .

<https://www.nps.gov/articles/mohs-hardness-scale.htm>
