    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "https://www.nps.gov/aboutus/disclaimer.htm (fetched 2026-10-04): \"material created by the National Park Service and presented on this website, unless otherwise indicated, is generally considered in the public domain.\" The illustration whose alt text lists the scale is credited \"NPS illustration by Heather Walborn, Guest Scientist (2013-2014), NPS Geologic Resources Division\", so its status is uncertain; recorded as unknown and used for verification only."@en .

