    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Wikidata:Licensing: \"All structured data (i.e. the main, Property, Lexeme, and EntitySchema namespaces) is released into the public domain under Creative Commons Zero.\""@en .

<https://www.nobelprize.org/prizes/lists/all-nobel-peace-prizes/>
    dcterms:title "NobelPrize.org: the summary page of every Nobel Peace Prize year and the laureates' facts pages" ;
    dcterms:creator "Nobel Prize Outreach" ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "https://www.nobelprize.org/about/terms-of-use/: \"Everything, including but not limited to the articles, texts, photographs, images, data, files, audio and video clips, illustrations, designs, educational games and documentation in whole or in part (the “Content”) which appears on the Site is either proprietary to Nobel Prize Outreach or used in accordance with applicable law or third party consents. You may not reproduce, distribute, display, transmit, modify, perform, adapt, generate derivative works or otherwise use the Content without prior written permission […]\" (the sentence goes on to list exceptions for press use, legislative exemptions and educators; the deck relies on none of them); and \"you may not use the Nobel Foundation trademarks without prior written permission from the Nobel Foundation\", which lists \"Nobel Prize®\" among them; every page ends \"Copyright © Nobel Prize Outreach 2026\"."@en .

<https://sv.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nobels_fredspris>
    dcterms:title "Wikipedia på svenska: Nobels fredspris (Kronologisk lista över pristagare) and the articles Internationella fredsbyrån, Óscar Arias, Dalai lama and Tenzin Gyatso" ;
