<https://www.rodakorset.se/siteassets/dokument/om-oss/stadgar-fran-2026.pdf>
    dcterms:title "Stadgar för föreningen Svenska Röda Korset (gällande från 2026-01-01)" ;
    dcterms:creator "Svenska Röda Korset" ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The 24-page PDF states no licence and no copyright notice; with no licence it is treated as all rights reserved and used for verification only."@en .

<https://data.riksdagen.se/dokumentlista/?sok=%22R%C3%B6dakorsf%C3%B6reningarnas+f%C3%B6rbund%22&utformat=json&sz=50>
