    dcterms:creator "Mammal Diversity Database (American Society of Mammalogists)" ;
    dcterms:license <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/> ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21654811 — the Zenodo record of the release (metadata title 'Mammal Diversity Database', version 'v2.5', publication date 2026-07-28, creator 'Mammal Diversity Database', DOI 10.5281/zenodo.21654811, concept DOI 10.5281/zenodo.4139722) has \"license\": {\"id\": \"cc-by-4.0\"}. The MDD home page (https://www.mammaldiversity.org/) says \"Current version: v2.5, released July 28, 2026\" and asks to be cited as \"Mammal Diversity Database. (2026). Mammal Diversity Database (Version 2.5) [Data set]. Zenodo.\""@en .

