<https://whc.unesco.org/en/list/>
    dcterms:title "UNESCO World Heritage Centre: the World Heritage List (XML export), the States Parties pages of Sweden, Norway, Denmark, Finland and Iceland, and New Inscribed Properties (48COM, 2026)" ;
    dcterms:creator "UNESCO World Heritage Centre" ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "https://whc.unesco.org/en/disclaimer/ (Internet Archive capture of 2026-09-22, https://web.archive.org/web/20260922044945/https://whc.unesco.org/en/disclaimer/), \"Terms / Policies\": under \"Intellectual Property\" the licence for \"© UNESCO\" material is given as \"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 IGO\", while the \"Linking Policy\" says \"You may only link to, not replicate content.\" and \"You may not sell, license, or otherwise assign the use of any material from UNESCO’s or the World Heritage Centre’s web site.\" The terms are mixed and CC BY-SA 3.0 IGO is not among the builder's licences, so the site is recorded as \"unknown\" and used for verification only."@en .

<https://www.raa.se/evenemang-och-upplevelser/upplev-kulturarvet/varldsarv-i-sverige/>
