    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Footer of every Swedish Wikipedia article (e.g. https://sv.wikipedia.org/wiki/V%C3%A4rldsarv_i_Danmark): \"Wikipedias text är tillgänglig under licensen Creative Commons Erkännande-dela-lika 4.0 Unported\""@en .

<https://www.nps.gov/orgs/1207/interior-department-celebrates-selection-of-pennsylvania-s-historic-moravian-bethlehem-district-to-unesco-world-heritage-list.htm>
    dcterms:title "U.S. National Park Service: \"Interior Department Celebrates Selection of Pennsylvania’s Historic Moravian Bethlehem District to UNESCO World Heritage List\" (news release, 26 July 2024)" ;
    dcterms:creator "U.S. National Park Service" ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "https://www.nps.gov/aboutus/disclaimer.htm, \"Ownership\": \"Copyright law does not protect “any work of the U.S. Government” where “a work prepared by an officer or employee of the U.S. Government as part of that person's official duties” (See, 17 U.S.C. §§ 101, 105). Thus, material created by the National Park Service and presented on this website, unless otherwise indicated, is generally considered in the public domain.\" The news release is the National Park Service's own text."@en .

