    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "NIST Copyrights & Disclaimers (https://www.nist.gov/oism/copyrights; the page gives its address as https://www.nist.gov/copyrights-disclaimers): \"With the exception of material marked as copyrighted, information presented on NIST sites are considered public information and may be distributed or copied. Use of appropriate byline/photo/image credits is requested.\" The prefix table is not marked as copyrighted."@en .

