    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "All rights reserved. Microsoft Terms of Use, https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/legal/terms-of-use (fetched 2026-10-04): \"Unless otherwise specified, the Services are for your personal and non-commercial use. You may not modify, copy, distribute, transmit, display, perform, reproduce, publish, license, create derivative works from, transfer, or sell any information, software, products or services obtained from the Services.\" Used for verification only: nothing was copied."@en .

