    dcterms:creator "IEEE and The Open Group" ;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Footer of every page, e.g. https://pubs.opengroup.org/onlinepubs/9799919799/utilities/ls.html (fetched 2026-10-04): \"Copyright © 2001-2024 The IEEE and The Open Group, All Rights Reserved\". Verification only."@en .

