    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Licence: the curl licence, an MIT/X-style licence, recorded as \"unknown\" only because the builder has no licence id for it. https://curl.se/docs/copyright.html (fetched 2026-10-04): \"Copyright (c) 1996 - 2026, Daniel Stenberg, daniel@haxx.se, and many contributors, see the THANKS file. All rights reserved. Permission to use, copy, modify, and distribute this software for any purpose with or without fee is hereby granted, provided that the above copyright notice and this permission notice appear in all copies.\" Because the licence requires its notice, the page is used for verification only: nothing is copied from it."@en .

<https://man.openbsd.org/ssh.1>
