    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A work of the United States Government (the page footer reads “Office of the Historian, Shared Knowledge Services, Bureau of Administration United States Department of State”): 17 U.S.C. § 105 (https://www.law.cornell.edu/uscode/text/17/105): “Copyright protection under this title is not available for any work of the United States Government”. The Department's copyright page (https://www.state.gov/copyright-information/) answered 403 to the research environment. Used for verification only, so the deck does not depend on this assessment."@en .

